5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to understand the reporting burden before committing. I will look into the appraisal needs at the last audit and independent checks on holdings' reported figures.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I will examine the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I want to see which of our past wins actually kept their customers. I will look into account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I need to know what the years after a first round demand of us. I will look into reserve accounts and follow-on calls, and the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I will look into security review time before first deployment and delivery records of two holdings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, your focus on deployment delays is sharp. I’m concerned about the verification gap. Do you think security reviews will be the main bottleneck for our candidates?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, I’m less worried about the review itself than the people we’ll need to staff it. Let’s see if our recruiters can actually find them.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, I appreciate the focus on staffing. I am more interested in whether our past investments actually held onto their customers.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, I understand the need for historical context. My priority is ensuring we have the liquidity to support these companies through their growth phases.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, not just reviews. I want to know if the hardware itself stalls. Let’s see if the delivery records match the promises.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, hardware delays are real, but I worry about the numbers we can’t verify. If we can’t check the figures, how do we trust the valuation?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, verification is vital, but without the right people to run the checks, the numbers are just guesses. Let’s see who we can actually hire.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I hear your concern about verification. But I am more worried about whether our past stories match the actual returns. Let us see what the data says.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, verification is important, but I am more concerned about the cash flow. We need to know if we can afford the follow-on calls before we commit.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, cash flow is vital, but if the product never ships, the money is gone. I need to know if the hardware actually arrives on time.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, I hear you. But if the product ships and we can’t verify the numbers, we’re flying blind. Let’s see what the data reveals.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, agreed. But if we can’t find the people to run those checks, the data is useless. Let’s see who we can actually hire.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I agree. Let us see what the data reveals.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, I agree. Let’s see what the data reveals.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
