38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The reserve accounts are bleeding. Follow-on calls hit twice the model, and two called it early. We are underwater.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Misaki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Misaki**: The reserve accounts are bleeding. Follow-on calls hit twice the model, and two called it early. We are underwater.""}]}"
