43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, the credit line won’t help. It ignores subscription contracts, which is exactly what we hold. We are exposed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, that exposure is critical. But if the product stalls in security review, the cash drain accelerates. I need to know if the hardware actually ships.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Misaki, that liquidity gap is alarming. I need to know if our new holding’s reporting will make our quarter-end even harder to close.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, if the credit line ignores subscriptions, we are trapped. I need to know if we can even staff the teams to fix this before the next call.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, that is a heavy burden. I worry that our past stories of success may have masked just how fragile these cash flows truly are.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the hardware risk is real, but the liquidity gap is immediate. We cannot absorb another early exit without a clear borrowing path.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, I understand the liquidity risk. But if the hardware never ships, the cash drain is permanent. I need to know if the delivery records match the promises.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
