52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, I am deeply concerned. If our past successes were built on fragile foundations, we must be honest about what we have truly achieved.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the liquidity gap is immediate. We cannot absorb another early exit without a clear borrowing path.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
