66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, with four options, I need to know which one won’t drain our recruiters for months. Who needs a shift supervisor?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, that is a fair question. I am looking at which of these kept their customers when prices rose, to see who is truly sticky.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, Fabric Loop needs those crews. But with our reserves bleeding, I cannot fund a company that requires constant physical staffing.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, Fabric Loop is a trap. I need to know if the sensor hardware actually ships on time, or if we are just buying another delay.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, the sensor hardware is a verification nightmare. If we can’t check the field readings, I won’t sign off.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, the field sensors are actually our best bet. They send verifiable readings, unlike the software dashboards. Plus, our new logistics advisers can help with the hardware.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, I am glad you see the value in verifiable data. But I must ask: did the sensor company keep its customers when prices rose, or did they drift away?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, the sensor company kept nine of ten accounts. That retention, plus verifiable data, makes it the safest choice for our strained reserves.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, the retention is strong, but I need to know if the sensors actually shipped on time. Did the hardware stall, or did it deliver?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, the delivery records show the bank tool never missed a release. The sensor hardware is the risk, but the verifiable data outweighs it for me.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, the bank tool proves software reliability. The sensor hardware is the risk, but the verifiable data outweighs it for me.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, the records show the field instruments kept nine of ten accounts. That loyalty suggests the hardware delivered value, not just promises.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, the retention proves the value. The liquidity risk is real, but this is the only option that doesn't bleed us dry. I vote for Harvest Sensor.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, the bank tool proves software reliability. The sensor hardware is the risk, but the verifiable data outweighs it for me.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
